Attribution for vendored code and data
======================================

Lightspeed vendors two third-party works: the gopls position/edit
machinery under internal/gopls/ (BSD-3-Clause) and the nvim-lspconfig
server-configuration corpus under internal/gen/corpus/ (Apache-2.0).
Each is covered below, with its provenance and its licence.


